<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — Code-to-model traceability: 56/100" ;
