    dct:description "Basic docstrings are present, but functions lack explicit equation and figure mappings to Sheth et al. (2012) Figs. 1-4 & Supplementary Eqs. (S1)-(S6), Raspopovic et al. (2014) Bmp-Sox9-Wnt Turing kinetics, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_015_hox_turing_polydactyly.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
