    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L78-95) returns only 2 analytical scalar endpoints (k_c(1.0) = 5.0 and k_c(0.0) = 14.0) without measuring nonlinear PDE digit peak counts, inter-digit wavelength shrinkage across the 6-genotype series, negative-control amplitude suppression, or segmented radiograph digit ray spacing CV." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
