    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-hoxa13-hoxd11-13-gli3-triple-null-wavenumber-k-c-h-0-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-wt-pentadactyl-turing-wavenumber-k-c-h-1-0> ;
    pk:hasScore 4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — MorphoEval overall 46.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py` (overall weighted score: 48.0 / 100). The v1 baseline script computes the analytical critical wavenumber k_c(H) for WT (5.0 digits) and triple-null Hoxa13-/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- (14.0 digits), but synthesizes spatial digit patterns via a closed-form cosine heuristic (`synthesize_fan_digits`) rather than numerically integrating the nonlinear cubic-saturated 2-component Turing reaction-diffusion PDE on a fan-shaped polar autopod domain with zero-flux Neumann boundaries; omits the intermediate genotypes of Sheth et al.'s 6-step allelic series (Gli3-/-, Hoxd11-13+/-;Gli3-/-, Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/-, Hoxa13+/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/-) and negative controls (equal diffusion Du=Dv and sub-Turing proximal zeugopod ablation); does not load or segment the vendored vertebrate autopod radiograph specimen; and returns only 2 scalar measurements without PDE peak counts or specimen morphometrics. Overall 46.0/100 (faithfulness 39.1, reproducibility 62.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 50, Morphological realism / specimen match 28, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 40, Source and data traceability 60, Code-to-model traceability 56, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/hox_turing_polydactyly_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py at 8871db0, image/png, 57567 B, 1300×546 px, artifact_sha256 ccd851d68225e7944e1b4a8235f9bc2dbb71d45918f5b5fd14f78f670df611af (sha256 ccd851d68225e7944e1b4a8235f9bc2dbb71d45918f5b5fd14f78f670df611af), spec_fingerprint abe9a76dd59fb62acd39e960662df4cc18109f96295cff9d50eee77bc05fa42d. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: abe9a76dd59fb62acd39e960662df4cc18109f96295cff9d50eee77bc05fa42d; artifact_sha256: ccd851d68225e7944e1b4a8235f9bc2dbb71d45918f5b5fd14f78f670df611af; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/hox_turing_polydactyly_reference.json=864482554d2a8657..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/scout_manifest.json=c0608869f6d213a4..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/vertebrate_autopod_digits_specimen.jpg=995e43a2a0cf7815...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameters (--hox-dose, --Du, --Dv, --fv, --gv, --steps, --seed), expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 reference-backed morphometric measurements, and upgrade `docs/media/hox_turing_polydactyly_comparison.png` (8-panel synthesis figure) and `docs/media/hox_turing_polydactyly_growth.gif` (6-genotype allelic progression GIF).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/hox_turing_polydactyly_reference.json`, `vertebrate_autopod_digits_specimen.jpg`, `scout_manifest.json`, and `paper_citations.bib` at runtime; segment the 6 digit rays and inter-digit spacing directly from the hexadactylous autopod radiograph; and compare biological digit ray spacing CV against the nonlinear Turing PDE.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the static cosine wave heuristic with a genuine nonlinear 2-component cubic-saturated Turing reaction-diffusion PDE solver (du/dt = f_u(H)*u + f_v*v - u^3 + D_u*Lap(u), dv/dt = g_u(H)*u + g_v*v + D_v*Lap(v)) with zero-flux Neumann boundary conditions on both the 1D distal autopod arc and the 2D polar fan-shaped limb bud sector (curvilinear Laplace-Beltrami operator (1/r) d/dr(r du/dr) + (1/r^2) d^2u/dtheta^2 showing 2 proximal zeugopod elements expanding into N(H) distal autopod digit rays).",
        "remediation needed: Simulate the complete 6-genotype allelic series of Sheth et al. (2012) Figs. 1-2 (WT 5 digits -> Gli3-/- 7 digits -> Hoxd11-13+/-;Gli3-/- 8 digits -> Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 9 digits -> Hoxa13+/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 11 digits -> Hoxa13-/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 14 digits) at constant autopod arc width L = 2500 um, plus dual negative controls (equal diffusion Du = Dv = 0.5 and sub-Turing ablation fu = 1.5 < 2.0)." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — Parameter expressivity: 44/100" ;
